<p>Hi,</p>
<p>A payment on your NewRelay instance could not be completed.</p>
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin: 8px 0 16px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155;">Action</td>
    <td align="right" style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A;">{{ meta.action }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% if meta.payment_provider %}
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155;">Provider</td>
      <td align="right" style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A;">{{ meta.payment_provider }}</td>
    </tr>
  {% endif %}
  {% if meta.account_name %}
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155;">Account</td>
      <td align="right" style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A;">{{ meta.account_name }} (#{{ meta.account_id }})</td>
    </tr>
  {% endif %}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155;">Error</td>
    <td align="right" style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #B45309;">{{ meta.message }}</td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p>Check Super Admin → Accounts → Billing Activity Logs for the full history.</p>
